cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SIEVER, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "SIEVER: Scale Item Evaluation and Validation Environment in R"
abstract: >-
  An interactive environment for developing constructs and instruments,
  evaluating score interpretations and intended uses, and retaining the
  evidence and researcher decisions behind them. The Shiny application
  connects item and facet assignments, screening, exploratory and
  confirmatory factor analysis, reliability with confidence intervals,
  validity-related analyses, scoring, and internal evaluation. Project
  files preserve data, transformations, specifications, and decision
  records. Estimation is delegated to DMAR, lavaan, and psych; favorable
  coefficients or model fit do not by themselves establish validity.
version: 0.9.0
date-released: "2026-11-20"
